This license covers the original source code in this repository only.

Valheim is copyright Iron Gate Studio AB. This project is an unofficial,
unaffiliated modification. It references the game's assemblies at build time
and patches them at runtime, but redistributes none of the game's code or
assets - you must own and install Valheim yourself. Nothing under bin/ or obj/
(including the publicized game assemblies the build produces locally) is
covered by this license or redistributable.

Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses and are declared as
dependencies rather than bundled here - install them separately per SETUP.md.
Jotunn (JotunnLib) ships as MIT per its NuGet package metadata; for BepInEx
and HarmonyX, see their respective projects for current terms.
